    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "teens-tens",
        "title": "Namba 11 hadi 100",
        "body": [
          "Kumi na moja hadi kumi na tisa zina majina yao: **eleven**, **twelve**, kisha **thirteen**… **nineteen** (huishia **-teen**).",
          "Makumi huishia **-ty**: **twenty**, **thirty**, **forty**, **fifty**. Kisha ongeza namba: **twenty-one** (ishirini na moja). Mia ni **a hundred**, elfu ni **a thousand**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "english-time",
        "title": "Saa ya Kiingereza si saa ya Kiswahili",
        "body": [
          "Saa ya Kiswahili huanza alfajiri: **saa moja asubuhi** ni saa 7:00. Kiingereza huhesabu kutoka usiku wa manane: **seven o’clock** (saa moja asubuhi).",
          "Kanuni rahisi: ongeza au toa sita. Saa mbili asubuhi ni **eight o’clock**. **Half past seven** ni 7:30 (saa moja na nusu). Asubuhi ni **a.m.**, mchana na jioni **p.m.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Saa mbili, mifumo miwili",
        "body": [
          "Afrika Mashariki watu wengi hutumia saa ya Kiswahili wanapozungumza Kiswahili, na saa ya Kiingereza wanapozungumza Kiingereza. Ukiambiwa **at eight** kwa Kiingereza, ni saa mbili asubuhi kwa Kiswahili."
        ]
      }
    ]
